    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112123" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορμηδόν</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορμός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like
