				2.75
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἐπὶ ἁμάξας
			ἐπιβαλόντες</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς
			νεκρούς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.48
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.530
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				2.312J.
			</span></i></div>
